      "content": "That's a good start. I want to make sure the caption is backed up by some actual reasoning for our blog post too. Can you give me a quick breakdown of the main psychological or sociological arguments that support why traditional family structures specifically help with child development? I want to make sure we have the \"why\" figured out.",
